    "family": "stick-chair",
    "notes": "INVENTED TEST FIXTURE — NOT a golden spec and NOT a measured chair. Every number here was written to exercise the SPEC v0.2 curve paths (traced seat outline, comb curved in plan, steam-bent armbow with short spindles, splayed legs, blind stick tenons into the comb bottom); none of it was measured off a real piece. The proportions are Schwarz-ish stick-chair territory so the drawing looks like a chair, but do not build from it and do not treat any value as ground truth — that is what specs/jp-armchair.json and specs/jp-bench.json are for. The comb is traced as a true 24 in arc so the plan prints a fitted radius; the armbow is traced as a 9 1/2 in radius U so its span and apex depth are derived, not stored."
